#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom_Text_IntroSpeech"
msgid ""
"Welcome, challenger!\n"
"I'm SIDNEY of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
"I like that look you're giving me.\n"
"I guess you'll give me a good match.\l"
"That's good! Looking real good!\p"
"All right! You and me, let's enjoy\n"
"a battle that can only be staged\l"
"here in the POKéMON LEAGUE!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎你，挑战者！\n"
"我是四天王花月。\p"
"我喜欢你看我的那种眼神。\n"
"看来你能和我好好打一场。\l"
"很好！看起来真不错！\p"
"好了！你和我，一起来享受\n"
"只有在宝可梦联盟才能上演的\l"
"对战吧！$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom_Text_Defeat"
msgid ""
"Well, how do you like that? I lost!\n"
"Eh, it was fun, so it doesn't matter.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你看看！我输了！\n"
"嘛，玩得很开心，无所谓啦。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom/scripts.inc:81
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_SidneysRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech"
msgid ""
"Well, listen to what this loser has\n"
"to say.\p"
"You've got what it takes to go far.\n"
"Now, go on to the next room and enjoy\l"
"your next battle!$"
msgstr ""
"好啦，听听我这个输家\n"
"要说的话吧。\p"
"你有能走得很远的实力。\n"
"好了，去下一个房间，\l"
"享受你的下一场对战吧！$"
